abstract: >-
  UI Iceberg is open-source UI journey assurance and test-scenario intelligence.
  It generates bounded journey scenarios, maps them against existing tests, and
  preserves unknown or weak evidence instead of normalizing it to pass.
keywords:
  - ui testing
  - journey assurance
  - test scenarios
  - Playwright
  - AI coding agents
  - quality assurance
